    "description": "This protocol includes two questions from the Wave 7 Youth Population Assessment of Tobacco and Health (PATH) Survey and one question from the \"Changes in Peer and Parent Influence During Adolescence: Longitudinal Versus Cross-Sectional Perspectives on Smoking Initiation\" publication (Chassin et al.",
